Z||000011||Songman||06-11-2001||11:44 PM||||Yeah.. I think I am against the death penalty too. I would much rather keep criminals up in a lifestyle in which bleeding hearts say they are entitled. Since I have to pay taxes anyway I would rather it be wasted on heartless bastards like McVeigh than trying to feed hungry kids or something...<P>If it had to happen, the bombing I mean, thank God that it was a Federal crime instead of some state that wouldn't apply the death penalty! The way I read it, the same Bible that says Thou Shalt Not Kill also says an eye for an eye. And there are a lot of little eyes that will never open again thanks to him...<P>And that is just one case... think of all the vicious crimes that happen every day that are never so high profile. Some people are just evil. Until we find a place to ship them to keep them away from good people, capital punishment is the best way to get rid of them. And I guarantee, if half the people that are in prisons today thought that they would have faced the death penalty, they would not have done the crime. I wish my life was so easy!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
